# Sandbox values for crew's workers and previews. NEVER put production secrets here.
# This file is read by crew (mode 600) and passed to coders, verifiers and previews.

# Only if the project uses crew's Postgres (project.json "db"):
# PGHOST=127.0.0.1
# PGPORT=20150
# PGUSER=crew
# PGPASSWORD=change-me

# Test or sandbox keys the project needs to run its tests (dummies are fine for most):
# SOME_API_KEY=dummy
